  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper evaluates QAOA for a 20-node Max-Cut investor-clustering problem using simulators (cuQuantum, Cirq-GPU, Cirq-IonQ). Relative errors of 23.1%, 24.2%, and 50.9% are reported compared to an exact brute-force solution, with runtimes of 6930.8 s, 15.7 s, and 252.6 s respectively, while brute force solves the instance exactly in 112.6 s. Additional experiments validate a classical spectral graph compression method achieving ~89.4% Max-Cut approximation at 50% compression.",
